on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <2>
  [  5] extcall 50 .............................. <soundBusy(2)>
  [  8] not ..................................... <not soundBusy(2)>
  [  9] jmpifz [ 33] ............................ if not soundBusy(2) then
  [ 12] pushsymb 42 ............................. <#playFile>
  [ 15] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 18] getglobal 32 ............................ <effectspath>
  [ 21] getglobal 118 ........................... <whichsnd>
  [ 24] joinstr ................................. <effectspath & whichsnd>
  [ 25] pushcons 0 .............................. <".aif">
  [ 27] joinstr ................................. <effectspath & whichsnd & ".aif">
  [ 28] pusharglistnoret 3 ...................... <2, effectspath & whichsnd & ".aif">
  [ 30] extcall 43 .............................. sound playFile 2, effectspath & whichsnd & ".aif"
  [ 33] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 35] extcall 1 ............................... whatodoeveryframe()
  [ 37] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 38] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0>
  [ 40] extcall 2 ............................... <marker(0)>
  [ 42] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(0)>
  [ 44] extcall 3 ............................... go(marker(0))
  [ 46] ret
end
